  "content": "[Intro]\n[D]I spent a long [G]time\n[A]watering a plant [D]made out of plas-\n[Bm]tic And I cursed [E7]the ground for gro-\n[A7]wing green [D]\n[D]I spent a long [G]time\n[A]substituting [F#]honest with sarcas-\n[Bm]tic And I cursed [E7]my tongue for be-\n[A7]ing mean [D]And\n\n[Verse]\n[Em]weightless, breathless [Bm]restitute\n[Em]Motionless and [Bm]absolute You\n[Em]cut me open, [Bm]sucked the poison\n[E]from an aging wound [F#]Now\n[Em]fifty thousand [Bm]war cadets Would\n[Em]cower at this small [Bm]brunette To\n[Em]my surprise, not six [Bm]feet high Who'd reach\n[F#]and grab the moon if I should Ask\n\n[Chorus]\n[Bm]or just imply [F#]That I wan-\n[F#m]ted a bit more light [E]So I could look\n[G]inside his eyes And get the\n[Gm]colors just right Just\n\n[Interlude]\n[Dm]right, just\n[Bb]right, [Gm]just\n[Dm]\n[Bb]  [Gm]\n[Dm]\n[Bb]  [Gm]\n[Dm]\n[Bb]  [Gm]\n[Dm]\n[Bb]  [Gm]\n[Dm]\n[Bb]  [Gm]\n[Dm]\n[Bb]  [Gm]\n[Dm]\n[Bb]  [Gm]\n[Dm]\n[Bb]  [Gm]\n[Dm]\n[Bb]  [Gm]\n[Dm]Build\n\n[Outro]\n[Gm]love, build God, build [A7]provinces Build\n[Dm]calluses, break promises 'Cause\n[Gm]I could never hold [A7]a perfect thing\n[Dm]and not demolish it What am I\n[Gm]thinking? What does this [A7]mean? How could some-\n[Dm]body ever love [F]me?\n[Gm]Talk to your man, tell him he's got\n[A]bad news comin'",
